---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="expeditions" title="Expedition Events" active="expedition-events" pageMark="🧭">
  The scripted “send a character off to explore distant lands” <strong>Expedition</strong> chains.
  Some entries are follow-ups that only fire after an earlier expedition via an event link. Each card
  shows what fires it, who's eligible, the guaranteed reward, and every response you can pick. See also
  <a href={`${base}ruin-events`}>Ruin Events</a> and the mission events on
  <a href={`${base}rally`}>Rally Troops</a> / <a href={`${base}hold-court`}>Hold Court</a> /
  <a href={`${base}steal-research`}>Steal Research</a>.
</EventGroupPage>
